# Accounting Chart of Account
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Accounting — the standard 5-type chart of accounts, hierarchical
# Case 9 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# External benchmark: runtime/benchmarks/003-accounting-vertical-survey.md
# (Study 6 + World-Class Standards Addendum: GAAP chart-of-accounts convention)

Chart of Account

Fields

- Account Code : Text
- Account Name : Text
- Account Type : Asset | Liability | Equity | Revenue | Expense
- Normal Balance : Debit | Credit
- Parent Account : Chart of Account
- Is Group : Boolean
- Status : Active | Inactive

Constraints

- Account Code is required.
- Account Name is required.
- Account Type is required.

Permissions

Accountant

- View

Supervisor

- View

Views

- Account Form : Form
- Account List : List
- Account Detail : Detail
